          "Translation": {
            "Text": "没有可供导入的节点。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "ExistingPostProcess",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "The mesh already has a Post Process Anim Blueprint. Disable assignment and merge the result manually."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "模型已有 Post Process Anim Blueprint；取消自动挂载后生成，再自行合并，避免覆盖。"
