          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "补偿蓝图 JSON（abpp）"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PoseNamesChanged",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Generated pose names differ from the source: "
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "生成的 Pose 名称与源数据不同: "
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PoseTitle",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Import Pose Drivers / Pose Assets"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "导入 Pose Driver / Pose Asset"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PostProcessAlreadySet",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "This blueprint is already the mesh's Post Process Anim Blueprint."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "当前蓝图已经是该网格体的后处理动画蓝图。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PostProcessCompileFailed",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "The blueprint could not be compiled. Fix its errors before assigning it as a Post Process Anim Blueprint."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "蓝图编译失败，请先修复编译错误，再设置为后处理动画蓝图。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PostProcessSet",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Set {0} as the Post Process Anim Blueprint for {1}. Save the mesh to keep this change. Ctrl+Z restores the previous assignment."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "已将 {0} 设为 {1} 的后处理动画蓝图。请保存网格体以保留设置；Ctrl+Z 可恢复原设置。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PreparePhysics",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "1. Prepare selected physics groups"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "1. 准备所选物理组"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "Prepared",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Ready. Use 'Add nodes to this blueprint' to insert the selected groups."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "准备完成。点击“添加节点到当前蓝图”插入所选分组。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PreparedCounts",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Prepared {0} Pose Drivers and {1} Kawaii Physics nodes.\nFolder: {2}\n"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "已准备 {0} 个 Pose Driver、{1} 个 Kawaii Physics 节点。\n目录：{2}\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "Preparing",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Preparing FModel animation groups..."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "正在准备 FModel 动画分组…"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PreviewMesh",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Preview mesh (read only)"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "预览网格体（只读）"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaAdditiveUnsupported",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Additive Pose Assets are not supported by this PSA import: "
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "此 PSA 导入流程暂不支持 Additive Pose Asset："
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaImportCount",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Expected one imported animation for each compensation group."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "每组补偿应导入一段动画。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaOutputHelp",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Animations and Pose Assets are saved in the POSE folder beside this blueprint. Existing assets are kept; new imports receive unique names."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "动画和 Pose Asset 保存在当前蓝图旁的 POSE 文件夹中。再次导入会自动使用新名称，保留已有资产。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaPoseCount",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "{0} must contain one animation with {1} sampled poses matching the Pose Asset JSON."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "{0} 必须包含一段动画，并具有与 Pose Asset JSON 对应的 {1} 个姿态采样。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaPoseHelp",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Choose abpp.json and the POSE folder. Import the selected PSA animations, create Pose Assets, then add their Pose Drivers to this blueprint."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "选择 abpp.json 和 POSE 文件夹，导入所选 PSA 动画并创建 Pose Asset，再将对应的 Pose Driver 添加到当前蓝图。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaPrepared",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Imported {0} PSA animations and created {0} Pose Assets. Ready to add Pose Drivers."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "已导入 {0} 段 PSA 动画并创建 {0} 个 Pose Asset，可以添加 Pose Driver。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaReady",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Choose abpp.json and its POSE folder, then read the groups. PSA animations will be imported automatically."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "选择 abpp.json 和 POSE 文件夹后读取分组，PSA 动画会由插件自动导入。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaRequiredBone",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "The PSA is missing a required compensation bone: "
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "PSA 中缺少必要的补偿骨骼："
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "PsaSourceFiles",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "{0} + {1}  ({2} poses)"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "{0} + {1}（{2} 个姿态）"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "ReadGroups",
          "Source": {
