          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "在资源管理器中定位所选 JSON 文件"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SaveFailed",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Failed to save: "
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "保存失败: "
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SelectAbpp",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Choose abpp.json..."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "选择 abpp.json…"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SelectAll",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Select all"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "全选"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SelectGroups",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Select at least one group."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "请至少选择一组。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SelectNone",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Clear selection"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "清空选择"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SelectPhysicsJson",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Choose physics blueprint JSON..."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "选择物理蓝图 JSON…"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SelectPoseFolder",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Choose POSE folder..."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "选择 POSE 文件夹…"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SeparateImports",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Choose exactly one import type: Pose Drivers or Kawaii Physics."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "每次只选择一种导入类型：Pose Driver 或 Kawaii Physics。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SetPostProcessButton",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "(Optional) 3. Set as mesh Post Process Anim Blueprint"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "（可选）3. 设为网格体后处理动画蓝图"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SetPostProcessHelp",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Compile this blueprint and assign it as the preview mesh's Post Process Anim Blueprint. Supports Undo; save the mesh to keep the change."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "编译当前蓝图并设置为预览网格体的后处理动画蓝图。支持撤销；保存网格体即可保留设置。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SetPostProcessTransaction",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Set mesh Post Process Anim Blueprint"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "设置网格体后处理动画蓝图"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SkipNonPoseHelp",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Pose import only. Bypass nodes such as Control Rig when they have exactly one pose input. Their effects are not restored. Multi-input branches are rejected; Kawaii Physics import is unchanged."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "仅用于 Pose 导入。对于 Control Rig 等节点，只有确定其唯一姿态输入时才会跳过，节点自身的效果不会还原。多输入分支会被拒绝；不改变 Kawaii Physics 导入。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SkipNonPoseNodes",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Skip non-Pose Driver nodes"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "跳过非 Pose Driver 节点"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "SkippedPoseNode",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Skipped {0}. This node's effects (such as Control Rig corrections) were not restored."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "已跳过 {0}。该节点自身的效果（例如 Control Rig 修正）未还原。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "StaleSelection",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "The selected groups no longer exist. Read the JSON again."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "所选分组已不存在，请重新读取 JSON。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "TargetGraph",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Target graph"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "目标图表"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "TargetMismatch",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "PoseTarget does not match the pose name or source-bone count: "
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "PoseTarget 与 Pose 名称或源骨骼数量不匹配: "
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "UnexpectedPhysicsNode",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "The physics JSON contains an unsupported non-KawaiiPhysics node."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "物理 JSON 中出现不支持的非 KawaiiPhysics 节点。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "UnexpectedPoseNode",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "The pose JSON contains an unsupported non-PoseDriver node."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "补偿 JSON 中出现不支持的非 PoseDriver 节点。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "UnsupportedChain",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "The pose chain contains an unsupported node: "
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "主姿态链包含尚不支持的节点，未自动展平: "
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "UnsupportedFields",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "{0} custom fields have no direct equivalent. Their original values are in the report; the original game physics behavior is not fully reproduced.\n"
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "原游戏 {0} 处定制字段没有直接对应，原值已保存在报告中；不代表原游戏物理逻辑已完整复现。\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "WiringHelp",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "New groups keep their internal connections and are placed below the existing graph. Connect their input and output to your pose flow. Graph insertion supports Undo; created assets remain in the Content Browser."
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "新节点保留组内连线，放在现有图表下方。请将输入和输出接入自己的姿态链。节点添加可撤销；已创建的资产会保留在内容浏览器中。"
          }
        },
        {
          "Key": "WrongPoseFile",
          "Source": {
            "Text": "Missing or mismatched Pose Asset data: "
          },
          "Translation": {
            "Text": "Pose Asset 数据缺失或不匹配："
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}